---
description: Testing and quality rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Testing requirements:
- Unit tests for domain logic.
- Unit tests for matching engine.
- Unit tests for ledger accounting.
- Unit tests for idempotency.
- Integration tests for PostgreSQL repositories.
- Integration tests for Ethereum local node when possible.
- Foundry tests for contracts.

Quality:
- Run gofmt.
- Run go test ./...
- Add make targets or scripts for common commands.
- Do not assume tests pass; inspect outputs.
- Prefer deterministic tests.
- Avoid tests that require mainnet.
